# Bootstrap package for permission management application concerns.
#
# The Permission value object is defined in the devflow-auth module:
#   com.devflow.modules.auth.domain.Permission
#
# This package holds the application-level permission registry,
# permission evaluator, and @PreAuthorize expression utilities
# that modules reference to enforce authorization.
#
# Naming convention: {resource}.{action} (e.g., project.read, task.create)
#
# Reference: docs/security/AUTHORIZATION_MODEL.md §6 (Permission Model)
